(551269, 55876, 7252, '<td valign="top">Too bad the highlights on the stones are blown. Very appropriate sign for the location. Might have been better to come back at different time of day when the lighting wasn''t as harsh. Perhaps also a perspective where the sign isn''t so centered. Possibly lower to the ground would also be a bit more dramatic.</td>', 'Too bad the highlights on the stones are blown. Very appropriate sign for the location. Might have been better to come back at different time of day when the lighting wasn''t as harsh. Perhaps also a perspective where the sign isn''t so centered. Possibly lower to the ground would also be a bit more dramatic.', '2004-01-21 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
