(551760, 56135, 13336, '<td valign="top">spartan, yet dynamic composition.  i love the color and texture of the bricks.  you angled this just right for capturing the geometry of the pattern properly.  nice work.</td>', 'spartan, yet dynamic composition.  i love the color and texture of the bricks.  you angled this just right for capturing the geometry of the pattern properly.  nice work.', '2004-01-21 09:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
