(552068, 55533, 14476, '<td valign="top">I am spellbound by this image.  Great find, but eventually I want to know the Canadian city where this signage is used, so I don''t drive there  :&gt;)    Anyhow, it''s beautifully photographed and well worth a 10.</td>', 'I am spellbound by this image.  Great find, but eventually I want to know the Canadian city where this signage is used, so I don''t drive there  :>)    Anyhow, it''s beautifully photographed and well worth a 10.', '2004-01-21 11:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(552069, 55909, 15751, '<td valign="top">the boarder is the best thing in this picture, although the shot is definately good in its own right</td>', 'the boarder is the best thing in this picture, although the shot is definately good in its own right', '2004-01-21 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(552070, 55433, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great timing; the horse appears to be perfectly mimicking the one on the sign.</td>', 'Great timing; the horse appears to be perfectly mimicking the one on the sign.', '2004-01-21 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(552071, 56085, 13759, '<td valign="top">A motion blur will add to this shoot.</td>', 'A motion blur will add to this shoot.', '2004-01-21 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(552073, 56136, 14476, '<td valign="top">Photograph may be a bit  overexposed, but it''s a great catch and a very funny sign.   9</td>', 'Photograph may be a bit  overexposed, but it''s a great catch and a very funny sign.   9', '2004-01-21 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(552074, 55754, 15751, '<td valign="top">and the road sign is where......?  Or is it like a theological sign?</td>', 'and the road sign is where......?  Or is it like a theological sign?', '2004-01-21 11:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552079, 55742, 15751, '<td valign="top">definately awesome, had to get lucky with this one!! how many tries did it take?</td>', 'definately awesome, had to get lucky with this one!! how many tries did it take?', '2004-01-21 11:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552081, 55825, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.  Love the motion in the last bus with the stopped busses in front.  Nicely composed, maybe exposure is a little ''hot'' but probably had to overexpose to get the motion. 9</td>', 'This is very well done.  Love the motion in the last bus with the stopped busses in front.  Nicely composed, maybe exposure is a little ''hot'' but probably had to overexpose to get the motion. 9', '2004-01-21 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(552082, 55704, 15751, '<td valign="top">good job! just wish the sign had a little more light on it, but thats almost impossible if you want to capture that beautiful sky too!</td>', 'good job! just wish the sign had a little more light on it, but thats almost impossible if you want to capture that beautiful sky too!', '2004-01-21 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(552084, 55530, 14476, '<td valign="top">Elegant composition, great exposure.  What more can one ask!    10</td>', 'Elegant composition, great exposure.  What more can one ask!    10', '2004-01-21 11:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552085, 56017, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve turned a mundane traffic light into a brilliant abstract. It almost looks like a view through a kaleidoscope, very nice.</td>', 'You''ve turned a mundane traffic light into a brilliant abstract. It almost looks like a view through a kaleidoscope, very nice.', '2004-01-21 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552086, 55514, 12733, '<td valign="top">You certainly came to the right place to find a sign for this challenge. Nice rendition of the sign; I like the sense of depth that the low angle gives and the nice, tight crop.</td>', 'You certainly came to the right place to find a sign for this challenge. Nice rendition of the sign; I like the sense of depth that the low angle gives and the nice, tight crop.', '2004-01-21 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(552087, 56055, 15751, '<td valign="top">ahh, tone down the brightness on the red a little!!  Otherwise nice job</td>', 'ahh, tone down the brightness on the red a little!!  Otherwise nice job', '2004-01-21 11:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(552088, 55393, 14476, '<td valign="top">Covered all the bases here.  Good catch and nicely photographed.   You were right to choose black and white.   8</td>', 'Covered all the bases here.  Good catch and nicely photographed.   You were right to choose black and white.   8', '2004-01-21 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552089, 56076, 15751, '<td valign="top">and the sign is where?</td>', 'and the sign is where?', '2004-01-21 11:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(552090, 56159, 13759, '<td valign="top">Oh, you catch a bird too, by free. The crop may be cut out this bird, no? The picture itself is great. Interesting theme.</td>', 'Oh, you catch a bird too, by free. The crop may be cut out this bird, no? The picture itself is great. Interesting theme.', '2004-01-21 11:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(552091, 55963, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a sign, and a beautiful composition and photo of a very quaint street as well. The tree makes a nice foreground element without being obtrusive.</td>', 'Quite a sign, and a beautiful composition and photo of a very quaint street as well. The tree makes a nice foreground element without being obtrusive.', '2004-01-21 11:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(552097, 55951, 12733, '<td valign="top">I agree with your decision to include the road and the car lights along with the sign. The twilight lighting is great, and the motion blur is not excessive.</td>', 'I agree with your decision to include the road and the car lights along with the sign. The twilight lighting is great, and the motion blur is not excessive.', '2004-01-21 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(552098, 55670, 15751, '<td valign="top">one of the better ones here! I wish the horizon was square with the frame, but im just picky like that, sorry!</td>', 'one of the better ones here! I wish the horizon was square with the frame, but im just picky like that, sorry!', '2004-01-21 11:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(552099, 55473, 15751, '<td valign="top">and the road sign is where?</td>', 'and the road sign is where?', '2004-01-21 11:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(552101, 55742, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific continuity with the road lighting and sign curves.  Nice to have the stars in some of the street lighting and it''s also what I think is a perfectly exposed image.  10</td>', 'Terrific continuity with the road lighting and sign curves.  Nice to have the stars in some of the street lighting and it''s also what I think is a perfectly exposed image.  10', '2004-01-21 11:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552102, 55648, 12733, '<td valign="top">I would normally not like this dull sky, but it does go well with the sign and make its point.</td>', 'I would normally not like this dull sky, but it does go well with the sign and make its point.', '2004-01-21 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552103, 55678, 15751, '<td valign="top">good angle</td>', 'good angle', '2004-01-21 11:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(552104, 55472, 15751, '<td valign="top">hahaha, wish it wasnt so gray</td>', 'hahaha, wish it wasnt so gray', '2004-01-21 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(552105, 56000, 14476, '<td valign="top">this is so funny!  Congratulations on a super find.</td>', 'this is so funny!  Congratulations on a super find.', '2004-01-21 11:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552106, 55942, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very scenic, and nicely lit and captured. IMHO the sign could be further to the left, but that''s being picky.</td>', 'Very scenic, and nicely lit and captured. IMHO the sign could be further to the left, but that''s being picky.', '2004-01-21 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552108, 55514, 15751, '<td valign="top">way to strike home with the voters!</td>', 'way to strike home with the voters!', '2004-01-21 11:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(552110, 56079, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a frozen moment. The tight cropping really works well with this subject.</td>', 'Nice capture of a frozen moment. The tight cropping really works well with this subject.', '2004-01-21 12:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552111, 55512, 13759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.', '2004-01-21 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(552112, 55530, 15751, '<td valign="top">nice curves!</td>', 'nice curves!', '2004-01-21 12:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(552113, 55873, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of headlight streaks to make a point. I also like the lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very effective use of headlight streaks to make a point. I also like the lighting and composition.', '2004-01-21 12:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(552115, 55586, 15751, '<td valign="top">this is the best one in the challenge.  Good Luck!</td>', 'this is the best one in the challenge.  Good Luck!', '2004-01-21 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552116, 56077, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, good perspective shot, humerous sign (in context: I''d climb the pole too if a tidal wave was coming)  plus the nice orange background to add a complimentary color.  Has it all!   10</td>', 'Oh, good perspective shot, humerous sign (in context: I''d climb the pole too if a tidal wave was coming)  plus the nice orange background to add a complimentary color.  Has it all!   10', '2004-01-21 12:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(552117, 55754, 12733, '<td valign="top">The clouds and sun rays are very striking against the silhouetted trees. Unfortunately, the sign seems to be more of a distraction than the subject.</td>', 'The clouds and sun rays are very striking against the silhouetted trees. Unfortunately, the sign seems to be more of a distraction than the subject.', '2004-01-21 12:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(552119, 55836, 14897, '<td valign="top">What a difficult focus control!!! The result is really very good.</td>', 'What a difficult focus control!!! The result is really very good.', '2004-01-21 12:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552120, 55569, 16052, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color make this pic interesting visually.</td>', 'Great composition and color make this pic interesting visually.', '2004-01-21 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552123, 56000, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. I like the background as well as the contrast in the signs. Those wooden supports look mighty flimsy for highway signs.</td>', 'Nice catch. I like the background as well as the contrast in the signs. Those wooden supports look mighty flimsy for highway signs.', '2004-01-21 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(552124, 55893, 16052, '<td valign="top">I guess you would have to play with orange balls.  Too funny.</td>', 'I guess you would have to play with orange balls.  Too funny.', '2004-01-21 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(552125, 55647, 16052, '<td valign="top">Great landsca, focus definitely needs to be sharpened.</td>', 'Great landsca, focus definitely needs to be sharpened.', '2004-01-21 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(552126, 55806, 13759, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect! The composition is beatiful. Nice colors, elements etc... Well the only thing that is not good is the sign. In order to get the same exposition as get, you need to use fill flash, or a second slave flash positioned near to the sign. If you can change the exposition, get the sign ca be more easy. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.</td>', 'Almost perfect! The composition is beatiful. Nice colors, elements etc... Well the only thing that is not good is the sign. In order to get the same exposition as get, you need to use fill flash, or a second slave flash positioned near to the sign. If you can change the exposition, get the sign ca be more easy. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.', '2004-01-21 12:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(552127, 55472, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great sign, nice sky and the angled viewpoint makes for a dynamic composition.</td>', 'Great sign, nice sky and the angled viewpoint makes for a dynamic composition.', '2004-01-21 12:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(552128, 55876, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtapostion, and the black and white was a good choice.</td>', 'Nice juxtapostion, and the black and white was a good choice.', '2004-01-21 12:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(552129, 56136, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha -- that''s a bizarre scene!</td>', 'Ha -- that''s a bizarre scene!', '2004-01-21 12:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552130, 55518, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is the sign inteneded for motorboats? I really like the soft, muted colors and mood of this shot, aside from the ironic sign.</td>', 'Is the sign inteneded for motorboats? I really like the soft, muted colors and mood of this shot, aside from the ironic sign.', '2004-01-21 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(552131, 55835, 16052, '<td valign="top">Crazy sign with excellent compositon and color.  Very pleasing visually.</td>', 'Crazy sign with excellent compositon and color.  Very pleasing visually.', '2004-01-21 12:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(552132, 56118, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute logo for a snow route. Is this a standard sign in your locality, or a one-of-a-kind.</td>', 'Very cute logo for a snow route. Is this a standard sign in your locality, or a one-of-a-kind.', '2004-01-21 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(552134, 56060, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think I can see what they mean, but it does come across as very confusing.</td>', 'I think I can see what they mean, but it does come across as very confusing.', '2004-01-21 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552136, 55885, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun.</td>', 'Cute pun.', '2004-01-21 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(552137, 55753, 13759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot. ', '2004-01-21 12:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552138, 55981, 16052, '<td valign="top">Looks like a giant lollipop.  Fantastic.</td>', 'Looks like a giant lollipop.  Fantastic.', '2004-01-21 12:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(552139, 56050, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice colorful collection of signs.</td>', 'A nice colorful collection of signs.', '2004-01-21 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552140, 55826, 16052, '<td valign="top">Focus and depth of field is perfect.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Focus and depth of field is perfect.  Nice composition.', '2004-01-21 12:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552142, 56069, 16052, '<td valign="top">Curious as to what exactly this is.</td>', 'Curious as to what exactly this is.', '2004-01-21 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(552144, 55347, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good use of the tree to block off the rather dead sky.</td>', 'Nice colors and good use of the tree to block off the rather dead sky.', '2004-01-21 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(552145, 55909, 16052, '<td valign="top">A little bit too soft on the focus for me.</td>', 'A little bit too soft on the focus for me.', '2004-01-21 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(552146, 56057, 13759, '<td valign="top">Humm, isso é coisa de brasileiro!</td>', 'Humm, isso é coisa de brasileiro!', '2004-01-21 12:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(552147, 56143, 12733, '<td valign="top">Shades of Bob Dylan. This is nicely composed and lit, and there''s enough traffic to bring it to life.</td>', 'Shades of Bob Dylan. This is nicely composed and lit, and there''s enough traffic to bring it to life.', '2004-01-21 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(552152, 55884, 12733, '<td valign="top">I get the impression that you had to do some looking at different angles  to get just this effect of the signs apparently touching. Very nice. The cloudy sky adds to the shot.</td>', 'I get the impression that you had to do some looking at different angles  to get just this effect of the signs apparently touching. Very nice. The cloudy sky adds to the shot.', '2004-01-21 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552153, 56069, 13759, '<td valign="top">To me it´s not a road sign, is a metal penis.</td>', 'To me it´s not a road sign, is a metal penis.', '2004-01-21 12:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(552154, 55875, 15411, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture but where is the Road sign...?</td>', 'Very cool picture but where is the Road sign...?', '2004-01-21 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552156, 55346, 16052, '<td valign="top">Black wording on sign difficult to read - probably just dirty.</td>', 'Black wording on sign difficult to read - probably just dirty.', '2004-01-21 12:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(552157, 55647, 13759, '<td valign="top">Widely softned. May be more constrast help it.</td>', 'Widely softned. May be more constrast help it.', '2004-01-21 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(552160, 56030, 14346, '<td valign="top">Now that is funny</td>', 'Now that is funny', '2004-01-21 12:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(552161, 56114, 13759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful composition. The picture reveals a underexposed sign. A common lack in this challenge. This happen because of metering system. In this type of pictures you need to target the horizon, setup the exposition, lock it, then recompose your scene focus and shoot. ', '2004-01-21 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(552162, 55393, 12733, '<td valign="top">Where in the world is this sign located? You got a nice sky for background, but IMHO the landscape should either have been included more or cropped out entirely.</td>', 'Where in the world is this sign located? You got a nice sky for background, but IMHO the landscape should either have been included more or cropped out entirely.', '2004-01-21 12:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(552164, 55407, 16052, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and tree silhouette.</td>', 'Love the colors and tree silhouette.', '2004-01-21 12:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(552165, 56100, 12733, '<td valign="top">These are great wooden signs. The setting sun gives a nice effect, but the background is otherwise very busy and not especially attractive.</td>', 'These are great wooden signs. The setting sun gives a nice effect, but the background is otherwise very busy and not especially attractive.', '2004-01-21 12:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(552168, 56041, 13759, '<td valign="top">I want to know this place... What is that green glare over the grass at the left side?</td>', 'I want to know this place... What is that green glare over the grass at the left side?', '2004-01-21 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552170, 55584, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very clever viewpoint although focus outside hole is headache producing.</td>', 'Very clever viewpoint although focus outside hole is headache producing.', '2004-01-21 12:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(552171, 55981, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, but why is this sign with no lettering here? The photo is quite pretty, and it is a good example of how breaking the rule against centering the subject can be effective.</td>', 'Very interesting, but why is this sign with no lettering here? The photo is quite pretty, and it is a good example of how breaking the rule against centering the subject can be effective.', '2004-01-21 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552173, 56159, 16052, '<td valign="top">Perfectly focused sign and exposure.  Heavied a tad heavily on left.  Too bad bird wasn''t in lower right corner.</td>', 'Perfectly focused sign and exposure.  Heavied a tad heavily on left.  Too bad bird wasn''t in lower right corner.', '2004-01-21 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552174, 55973, 12733, '<td valign="top">A colorful collection of signs against a leafy background, which effectively obscures the empty sky.</td>', 'A colorful collection of signs against a leafy background, which effectively obscures the empty sky.', '2004-01-21 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552177, 55333, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done all the way around.  Very pleasing to the eye.  Love the shapes and shadows.</td>', 'Very nicely done all the way around.  Very pleasing to the eye.  Love the shapes and shadows.', '2004-01-21 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(552178, 55934, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. What is the source of the blue light?</td>', 'Nice composition. What is the source of the blue light?', '2004-01-21 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(552179, 55914, 12733, '<td valign="top">The high key and the blur emphasize the meaning of the sign.</td>', 'The high key and the blur emphasize the meaning of the sign.', '2004-01-21 12:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(552181, 55996, 16052, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure.', '2004-01-21 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(552182, 55704, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely sky and a beautiful landscape. IMHO the sign should be off to one side so as not to break up the landscape shot. If it were on the left, the dog would appear to be looking into the scene, which would be very effective.</td>', 'This is a lovely sky and a beautiful landscape. IMHO the sign should be off to one side so as not to break up the landscape shot. If it were on the left, the dog would appear to be looking into the scene, which would be very effective.', '2004-01-21 12:27:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(552184, 55533, 12733, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this shot jumps out at you, very effective, almost painterly.</td>', 'The contrast in this shot jumps out at you, very effective, almost painterly.', '2004-01-21 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(552188, 55677, 12733, '<td valign="top">Tough to trespass with the fence and barbed wire. This looks like a military installation, with all that security. I think the background colors look kind of washed out.</td>', 'Tough to trespass with the fence and barbed wire. This looks like a military installation, with all that security. I think the background colors look kind of washed out.', '2004-01-21 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(552190, 55331, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done sepia image.  We better have the photo date verified for this challenge.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nicely done sepia image.  We better have the photo date verified for this challenge.  Nice job.', '2004-01-21 12:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552193, 55613, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, 10</td>', 'Great shot, 10', '2004-01-21 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(552194, 55623, 12733, '<td valign="top">The angle makes for a very dynamic shot, but also kind of disconcerting. It certainly takes something that might have been quite dull and adds drama.</td>', 'The angle makes for a very dynamic shot, but also kind of disconcerting. It certainly takes something that might have been quite dull and adds drama.', '2004-01-21 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552195, 55982, 13759, '<td valign="top">Oh, good shoot! Finally someone had the great idea to use the fill flash. The sign receives a bit more light than need, but are great as it are. Only the JPEG artifacts blows you. They are many and fully visible.</td>', 'Oh, good shoot! Finally someone had the great idea to use the fill flash. The sign receives a bit more light than need, but are great as it are. Only the JPEG artifacts blows you. They are many and fully visible.', '2004-01-21 12:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(552196, 55460, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo, 10</td>', 'Great photo, 10', '2004-01-21 12:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552197, 55511, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of blur to make a point.</td>', 'Very effective use of blur to make a point.', '2004-01-21 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(552199, 56055, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is a photo challenge not a digital art challenge</td>', 'This is a photo challenge not a digital art challenge', '2004-01-21 12:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(552200, 55913, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Very well done.</td>', 'Great idea! Very well done.', '2004-01-21 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(552203, 55905, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the background of buildings and bare branches. The sign works well with the composition.</td>', 'I like the background of buildings and bare branches. The sign works well with the composition.', '2004-01-21 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552204, 56002, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Love focus, depth of field, textures, and tones.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Love focus, depth of field, textures, and tones.', '2004-01-21 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(552206, 56015, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours and composition. 10</td>', 'Really nice colours and composition. 10', '2004-01-21 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(552208, 55870, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors make this a pleasing photo.</td>', 'Very pretty colors make this a pleasing photo.', '2004-01-21 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(552211, 55935, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur and light streaks. I assume that''s not what the symbols on the sign mean, but it gives that impression.</td>', 'Nice use of blur and light streaks. I assume that''s not what the symbols on the sign mean, but it gives that impression.', '2004-01-21 12:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
