(552297, 55514, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate sign! I like the use of black and white, it gives it a nice classy look, and I think that way the white overcast sky in the background is not as prominent, it just looks like a plain background. The tilt of the sign is a little offputting, but I can see the post is straight and so there was probably not much you could do with it. Very prominent and clear and has relevancy, good image!</td>', 'Very appropriate sign! I like the use of black and white, it gives it a nice classy look, and I think that way the white overcast sky in the background is not as prominent, it just looks like a plain background. The tilt of the sign is a little offputting, but I can see the post is straight and so there was probably not much you could do with it. Very prominent and clear and has relevancy, good image!', '2004-01-21 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(552299, 55919, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly different point of view but the background doesn''t really yell ''stop!'' or something bad will happen.  6</td>', 'I like the slightly different point of view but the background doesn''t really yell ''stop!'' or something bad will happen.  6', '2004-01-21 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(552301, 55742, 16052, '<td valign="top">Wow. Taillights match sign on exposure very closely.  I know this was difficult to pull off.</td>', 'Wow. Taillights match sign on exposure very closely.  I know this was difficult to pull off.', '2004-01-21 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(552304, 55678, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like it, nice composition.</td>', 'I like it, nice composition.', '2004-01-21 13:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(552305, 55914, 14773, '<td valign="top">I can''t decifer what this is all about..I''m not sure that the blur effect enhances this photo, as I cant'' tell what''s going on or what''s in the pic, the blur is taking away from your point in my opinion.</td>', 'I can''t decifer what this is all about..I''m not sure that the blur effect enhances this photo, as I cant'' tell what''s going on or what''s in the pic, the blur is taking away from your point in my opinion.', '2004-01-21 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(552306, 55894, 6008, '<td valign="top">First reaction is the humor quality of the sign. Yes, it''s a sign to warn others, but it could so be taken as a sign to blind people to cross there and that''s where the humor stems. Unfortunately the composition doesnt really do much for me. I like the curve of the pole but it feels like the whole thing only occupies a small area of the shot and the negative space doesnt really help it. A crop suggestion might be to have the top of the curve coming out of the top right corner and crop to the left of the sign, and unless there is a reason to crop below the sign, I would probably have made it a vertical composition rather than landscape. I believe that way the emphasis would have been more on the sign. I do like the use of the black and white, and the slight noise in the sky gives it a gritty urban feeling too.</td>', 'First reaction is the humor quality of the sign. Yes, it''s a sign to warn others, but it could so be taken as a sign to blind people to cross there and that''s where the humor stems. Unfortunately the composition doesnt really do much for me. I like the curve of the pole but it feels like the whole thing only occupies a small area of the shot and the negative space doesnt really help it. A crop suggestion might be to have the top of the curve coming out of the top right corner and crop to the left of the sign, and unless there is a reason to crop below the sign, I would probably have made it a vertical composition rather than landscape. I believe that way the emphasis would have been more on the sign. I do like the use of the black and white, and the slight noise in the sky gives it a gritty urban feeling too.', '2004-01-21 13:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(552310, 55755, 14773, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the photo isn''t great itself [lighting, etc]..I still give it a 5 for the idea.</td>', 'great idea, but the photo isn''t great itself [lighting, etc]..I still give it a 5 for the idea.', '2004-01-21 13:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(552311, 55836, 14773, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo...great subject matter adn nice framing</td>', 'This is a great photo...great subject matter adn nice framing', '2004-01-21 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(552312, 55972, 14773, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine why this sign would be put up....what does it represent to your culture { i realize it means "hell" but an english sign with hell crossed out still would puzzle alot of people I think}</td>', 'I can''t imagine why this sign would be put up....what does it represent to your culture { i realize it means "hell" but an english sign with hell crossed out still would puzzle alot of people I think}', '2004-01-21 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(552314, 56108, 6008, '<td valign="top">The quality of this shot is really not the best. There is a lot of noise in every part of it. The sign is not sharp at all, and also slightly tilted. It''s placed at dead center, which doesnt really do that much for it either. If you were wanting to do it in the middle I would suggest perhaps a portrait shot rather than landscape so that there isnt much space on either side of the sign.</td>', 'The quality of this shot is really not the best. There is a lot of noise in every part of it. The sign is not sharp at all, and also slightly tilted. It''s placed at dead center, which doesnt really do that much for it either. If you were wanting to do it in the middle I would suggest perhaps a portrait shot rather than landscape so that there isnt much space on either side of the sign.', '2004-01-21 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
