(552356, 56017, 6008, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to realise what this is, although I''m still wondering if it''s a reflector or an orange/amber stop light. It''s a great close-up, and an interesting abstract design as well. Very clear and sharp, and the noise between the black and white is actually kinda intriguing. I''m not a huge fan of abstract, but I like this.</td>', 'Took me a while to realise what this is, although I''m still wondering if it''s a reflector or an orange/amber stop light. It''s a great close-up, and an interesting abstract design as well. Very clear and sharp, and the noise between the black and white is actually kinda intriguing. I''m not a huge fan of abstract, but I like this.', '2004-01-21 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
