(552362, 56055, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant coloring. I lke the natural framing on either side with the bricks, although the different size is just a tad unbalancing. The stop sign really stands out from the background, good vertical composition. Maybe a little bit sharper would have been better, but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Very vibrant coloring. I lke the natural framing on either side with the bricks, although the different size is just a tad unbalancing. The stop sign really stands out from the background, good vertical composition. Maybe a little bit sharper would have been better, but it''s a good shot.', '2004-01-21 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552364, 56017, 11321, '<td valign="top">sorry, the white area on left-top corner is just too distracting. my eyes can''t rest on that picture... only if the white were black too.<br/>maybe it is just me.. anyway the orange is good find :) good luck</td>', 'sorry, the white area on left-top corner is just too distracting. my eyes can''t rest on that picture... only if the white were black too.maybe it is just me.. anyway the orange is good find :) good luck', '2004-01-21 14:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
