(552369, 56085, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Could maybe have done with a tad more sharpness but the contrasts are good. Is that the moon in the sky also? There seems to be a little bit of a haze around the sign, and the lights are a little bright, but otherwise the exposure is good. Ideally having the power lines cloned out would have been good, but I dont think it distracts from the image too much - it adds to the urbanness of the shot.</td>', 'Good composition. Could maybe have done with a tad more sharpness but the contrasts are good. Is that the moon in the sky also? There seems to be a little bit of a haze around the sign, and the lights are a little bright, but otherwise the exposure is good. Ideally having the power lines cloned out would have been good, but I dont think it distracts from the image too much - it adds to the urbanness of the shot.', '2004-01-21 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
