(552628, 55535, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a sign, but this is a great take on the challenge and a really interesting photo. I hope you''ll run a tutorial after the challenge to explain how you did it. I really like the 3-D effect where the tunnel seems to go right into the rock.</td>', 'I don''t see a sign, but this is a great take on the challenge and a really interesting photo. I hope you''ll run a tutorial after the challenge to explain how you did it. I really like the 3-D effect where the tunnel seems to go right into the rock.', '2004-01-21 17:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
