(552642, 56094, 259, '<td valign="top">i''m sure i won''t be the only one to say that it is oversharpened.  there are halos around everything.  i do like the composition, and i like the crop as well.</td>', 'i''m sure i won''t be the only one to say that it is oversharpened.  there are halos around everything.  i do like the composition, and i like the crop as well.', '2004-01-21 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552643, 56015, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot.  i like the realism by including the garbage.  it might be a tad too red overall, however, it''s still easily one of the best shots this week.</td>', 'great shot.  i like the realism by including the garbage.  it might be a tad too red overall, however, it''s still easily one of the best shots this week.', '2004-01-21 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(552645, 55491, 259, '<td valign="top">great lighting.  i really like how you''ve incorporated the reflective quality of the sign.  one question though.  wouldn''t it be yeild the rain?  anyway, one of the best shots this week.</td>', 'great lighting.  i really like how you''ve incorporated the reflective quality of the sign.  one question though.  wouldn''t it be yeild the rain?  anyway, one of the best shots this week.', '2004-01-21 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(552647, 56058, 15703, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, nicely framed and exposed. A relevant and well-executed submission.</td>', 'A nice idea, nicely framed and exposed. A relevant and well-executed submission.', '2004-01-21 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(552648, 55603, 7703, '<td valign="top">Great capture ... one thing I don''t like is that blue tone on the road sign. -9</td>', 'Great capture ... one thing I don''t like is that blue tone on the road sign. -9', '2004-01-21 17:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
