(552653, 55602, 7703, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this Stop signs because it is to many stop signs, both now and last year. I rate you down for stop sign.</td>', 'I don''t like this Stop signs because it is to many stop signs, both now and last year. I rate you down for stop sign.', '2004-01-21 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(552654, 55856, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot.  i actually like the gray sky.  it goes nicely with the grafiti theme.</td>', 'great shot.  i actually like the gray sky.  it goes nicely with the grafiti theme.', '2004-01-21 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(552656, 56052, 7703, '<td valign="top">Good idea but bad focus over the picture</td>', 'Good idea but bad focus over the picture', '2004-01-21 17:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552657, 55942, 259, '<td valign="top">talk about the sign being secondary.  really nice shot.</td>', 'talk about the sign being secondary.  really nice shot.', '2004-01-21 17:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552659, 55679, 15703, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.</td>', 'Very good shot.', '2004-01-21 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(552661, 55472, 259, '<td valign="top">seems slightly underexposed, and oversharpened.  as far as compostion goes i like it.</td>', 'seems slightly underexposed, and oversharpened.  as far as compostion goes i like it.', '2004-01-21 17:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(552664, 56043, 16062, '<td valign="top">looks like a fun shot.  The general lack of color seems to center attention on the drama of the scene.  I bet you were itching to clone that post out of the background!</td>', 'looks like a fun shot.  The general lack of color seems to center attention on the drama of the scene.  I bet you were itching to clone that post out of the background!', '2004-01-21 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(552665, 56042, 16062, '<td valign="top">Great color, great angle, and the high contrast lighting is very appropriate.  There''s nothing to indicate the size of the sign, and that works well here.  Great job!</td>', 'Great color, great angle, and the high contrast lighting is very appropriate.  There''s nothing to indicate the size of the sign, and that works well here.  Great job!', '2004-01-21 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(552672, 56002, 16062, '<td valign="top">I love how the shape on the sign mimics the shape of the building''s arches.  Nice range of colors(very balanced!)  Good light and a nice frame too.  Great job!</td>', 'I love how the shape on the sign mimics the shape of the building''s arches.  Nice range of colors(very balanced!)  Good light and a nice frame too.  Great job!', '2004-01-21 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552674, 56071, 12973, '<td valign="top">Something about signs like this make me think nostalgia....  I would have like to see this in sepia of B&amp;W.  Great pic!</td>', 'Something about signs like this make me think nostalgia....  I would have like to see this in sepia of B&W.  Great pic!', '2004-01-21 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(552683, 55331, 12973, '<td valign="top">NICE...looks like a postcard!</td>', 'NICE...looks like a postcard!', '2004-01-21 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(552686, 55460, 12973, '<td valign="top">A sign of the times............past. I like this shot.</td>', 'A sign of the times............past. I like this shot.', '2004-01-21 18:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552721, 55603, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, and a nice shot overall.  It would have been a bit better if you could have found an angle to eliminate the wires.  And somehow got a higher angle, e.g., if you have a LCD that moves like on my camera, you could holding your tripod and camera overhead and  still compose (if no higher perspective was available).  But this is certainly still one of the better road-sign shots!  It''s hard to make road signs look good.</td>', 'Very good idea, and a nice shot overall.  It would have been a bit better if you could have found an angle to eliminate the wires.  And somehow got a higher angle, e.g., if you have a LCD that moves like on my camera, you could holding your tripod and camera overhead and  still compose (if no higher perspective was available).  But this is certainly still one of the better road-sign shots!  It''s hard to make road signs look good.', '2004-01-21 18:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(552724, 55511, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent and creative idea to pan blur this.  Though I''m not sure how you did this, assuming the slow sign wasn''t moving for the pan!  Whatever, good effect.</td>', 'Excellent and creative idea to pan blur this.  Though I''m not sure how you did this, assuming the slow sign wasn''t moving for the pan!  Whatever, good effect.', '2004-01-21 18:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552725, 56006, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good catch of the interesting combinatiuon of the signs.  Not sure the perspective shot was important here, but the cloud background works nicely.</td>', 'Good catch of the interesting combinatiuon of the signs.  Not sure the perspective shot was important here, but the cloud background works nicely.', '2004-01-21 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(552726, 56005, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I reall like the effect the road below adds to this; gives one the feeling of the height/slope.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I reall like the effect the road below adds to this; gives one the feeling of the height/slope.', '2004-01-21 18:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552742, 55449, 12253, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s not in front of a school!  That would have been really cool.</td>', 'Too bad it''s not in front of a school!  That would have been really cool.', '2004-01-21 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
