(553220, 55613, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this, the whole thing blends really well together. The background is interesting in and of itself, as is the sign. There is a lot to see when you look around the shot, and it also generates interest beyond the scope of the shot too. The placement of the sign is good, although the perspective shift gives it a slight seeming tilt, but nothing extreme. It''s a good shot.</td>', 'I like this, the whole thing blends really well together. The background is interesting in and of itself, as is the sign. There is a lot to see when you look around the shot, and it also generates interest beyond the scope of the shot too. The placement of the sign is good, although the perspective shift gives it a slight seeming tilt, but nothing extreme. It''s a good shot.', '2004-01-22 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(553227, 56098, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how the path starts at the corner and moves diagonally into the shot and then wends out of it again. The colors give it a nice crispness to the day, but still has some warmth to it also. The shadows falling across the path also add some interest. The sign is prominent and yet it does not dominate the entire image by making the background just a dormant backdrop. Only nitpick is that the guy on the left blends into the shadows a little too much due to his dark clothing.</td>', 'I like how the path starts at the corner and moves diagonally into the shot and then wends out of it again. The colors give it a nice crispness to the day, but still has some warmth to it also. The shadows falling across the path also add some interest. The sign is prominent and yet it does not dominate the entire image by making the background just a dormant backdrop. Only nitpick is that the guy on the left blends into the shadows a little too much due to his dark clothing.', '2004-01-22 09:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(553234, 55393, 6008, '<td valign="top">The clouds are just on the verge of being too bright. The placement of the sign is good, and the angle compliments it rather than making it look askew, which seems to be one of the challenges of shooting signs. The negative space on the left also compliments the meaning of the sign.</td>', 'The clouds are just on the verge of being too bright. The placement of the sign is good, and the angle compliments it rather than making it look askew, which seems to be one of the challenges of shooting signs. The negative space on the left also compliments the meaning of the sign.', '2004-01-22 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(553239, 55909, 6008, '<td valign="top">I cant make up my mind if I like this or not. The sign is well placed in the shot, I have no idea what it says, but it looks interesting. The background of the mountain range is great, and I like the bend of the road. I actually even like the border! The truck gives the scene some movement, but it looks kinda blurry... that said I think that''s partly where the mood comes from. I dont want to say it''s gritty, and I''m not sure exactly what it is, but... I like it!</td>', 'I cant make up my mind if I like this or not. The sign is well placed in the shot, I have no idea what it says, but it looks interesting. The background of the mountain range is great, and I like the bend of the road. I actually even like the border! The truck gives the scene some movement, but it looks kinda blurry... that said I think that''s partly where the mood comes from. I dont want to say it''s gritty, and I''m not sure exactly what it is, but... I like it!', '2004-01-22 10:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553249, 56122, 6008, '<td valign="top">I guess having a simple shot of a sign straight on is a little boring, but not so sure that having it slightly askew is much better. The first thing I think is that it''s tilted. Beyond that the sky background is good, there''s some nice blue to it. The image is also sharp and clear. I just do not find much interest with it, sorry.</td>', 'I guess having a simple shot of a sign straight on is a little boring, but not so sure that having it slightly askew is much better. The first thing I think is that it''s tilted. Beyond that the sky background is good, there''s some nice blue to it. The image is also sharp and clear. I just do not find much interest with it, sorry.', '2004-01-22 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(553253, 55679, 11785, '<td valign="top">what did you do? I like idea sooo much!</td>', 'what did you do? I like idea sooo much!', '2004-01-22 10:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(553260, 55733, 11785, '<td valign="top">it must be near Zoo ;)<br/>nice colors, i like this picture -10</td>', 'it must be near Zoo ;)nice colors, i like this picture -10', '2004-01-22 10:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(553261, 55389, 11785, '<td valign="top">cool - 10 points!</td>', 'cool - 10 points!', '2004-01-22 10:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(553262, 55742, 11785, '<td valign="top">ehee, i like this shot - 10</td>', 'ehee, i like this shot - 10', '2004-01-22 10:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(553266, 55603, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition', '2004-01-22 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(553270, 55409, 16402, '<td valign="top">Not terribly creative. Could be any intersection anywhere with a lot of signs.</td>', 'Not terribly creative. Could be any intersection anywhere with a lot of signs.', '2004-01-22 10:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(553274, 55925, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like it because it makes a statement with the sign. Also like choice of B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like it because it makes a statement with the sign. Also like choice of B&W.', '2004-01-22 10:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553277, 55921, 16402, '<td valign="top">Another good shot with a message. I think i would have straightened image a bit  though.</td>', 'Another good shot with a message. I think i would have straightened image a bit  though.', '2004-01-22 10:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(553280, 55951, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sign is interesting but not enough for just a static photo, so I like the fact that vehicles were blurred to provide motion.</td>', 'Sign is interesting but not enough for just a static photo, so I like the fact that vehicles were blurred to provide motion.', '2004-01-22 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(553281, 55999, 16062, '<td valign="top">How about "You can''t make me!"</td>', 'How about "You can''t make me!"', '2004-01-22 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(553282, 56076, 16402, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with road signs?</td>', 'What does this have to do with road signs?', '2004-01-22 10:41:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(553284, 55586, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite pic of the lot! absolutely stunning! (10)</td>', 'This is my favourite pic of the lot! absolutely stunning! (10)', '2004-01-22 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(553285, 56120, 16402, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this fits the subject matter of road signs.</td>', 'I don''t think this fits the subject matter of road signs.', '2004-01-22 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(553293, 56073, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very creative, interesting take on subject. I especially like the reflection of a car''s stop lights.</td>', 'Very creative, interesting take on subject. I especially like the reflection of a car''s stop lights.', '2004-01-22 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(553294, 55433, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the angle.  From the thumbnail I thought maybe this was a real horse (that would be hard to do!) I like the shallow dof makes it seem a bit more real.  It is a bit disappointing tho - that it isn''t real.</td>', 'I like this idea and the angle.  From the thumbnail I thought maybe this was a real horse (that would be hard to do!) I like the shallow dof makes it seem a bit more real.  It is a bit disappointing tho - that it isn''t real.', '2004-01-22 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(553295, 55852, 16402, '<td valign="top">Creative take on subject matter.</td>', 'Creative take on subject matter.', '2004-01-22 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553297, 55586, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice juxtaposition and composition.</td>', 'Very nice juxtaposition and composition.', '2004-01-22 11:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(553298, 55569, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - the yellow lines such a strong diagonal, and the blue waing back and froth.  The car and the top and bit of a car at the left frame it nicely.  Wish I could understand what the blue line is for by looking at the picture.  The image lacks meaning.</td>', 'I like the composition - the yellow lines such a strong diagonal, and the blue waing back and froth.  The car and the top and bit of a car at the left frame it nicely.  Wish I could understand what the blue line is for by looking at the picture.  The image lacks meaning.', '2004-01-22 11:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(553299, 56063, 16402, '<td valign="top">Funny sign. Image seems a bit out of focus though. Could have benefited from cropping at top also.</td>', 'Funny sign. Image seems a bit out of focus though. Could have benefited from cropping at top also.', '2004-01-22 11:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(553302, 55971, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how you have captured the red lights just where tha arrow points at them.  The light on the signs is a bit too bright, especially in contrast with the darkness of the photo.  Cropping out some of the blackness on the right, bottom and left would focus the composition better.</td>', 'I like how you have captured the red lights just where tha arrow points at them.  The light on the signs is a bit too bright, especially in contrast with the darkness of the photo.  Cropping out some of the blackness on the right, bottom and left would focus the composition better.', '2004-01-22 11:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(553304, 55514, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is very good.</td>', 'This is very good.', '2004-01-22 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(553307, 56069, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lol Funny.</td>', 'Lol Funny.', '2004-01-22 11:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(553309, 55749, 16402, '<td valign="top">Being a golfer I really want to like this image, but I think it''s just a tad bit too dark, especially in the lower left portion of the sign.</td>', 'Being a golfer I really want to like this image, but I think it''s just a tad bit too dark, especially in the lower left portion of the sign.', '2004-01-22 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(553310, 55958, 7628, '<td valign="top">Us Amricans have a hard time with rotaries - noone seems to understand this basic YIELD to cars in the rotary thing!  You''ve got a disturbing angle here and all those squiggly lights - it does reflect how I feel when I''m in a rotary.  Wish the rotary sign were sharper, not quite so bright.  If there were something else - a car, a person, perhaps there would be more to ancor the eye.</td>', 'Us Amricans have a hard time with rotaries - noone seems to understand this basic YIELD to cars in the rotary thing!  You''ve got a disturbing angle here and all those squiggly lights - it does reflect how I feel when I''m in a rotary.  Wish the rotary sign were sharper, not quite so bright.  If there were something else - a car, a person, perhaps there would be more to ancor the eye.', '2004-01-22 11:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(553311, 55552, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny and good.</td>', 'Funny and good.', '2004-01-22 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(553312, 56135, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very simple but composition is excellent, lines are straight. Great shot.</td>', 'Very simple but composition is excellent, lines are straight. Great shot.', '2004-01-22 11:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(553313, 55704, 7628, '<td valign="top">Poor poochies!  It loks like alovely place.  Having the sign dead center really adds to the feeling of being forbidden - even keeps the viewer from seeing the whole scene.  Works thematically.  Wish there were more light onthe sign - a brighter flas (it looks like you has some flash on it)  Its just that with the brigh reflection of the sun in the water you get distracted from the sign.</td>', 'Poor poochies!  It loks like alovely place.  Having the sign dead center really adds to the feeling of being forbidden - even keeps the viewer from seeing the whole scene.  Works thematically.  Wish there were more light onthe sign - a brighter flas (it looks like you has some flash on it)  Its just that with the brigh reflection of the sun in the water you get distracted from the sign.', '2004-01-22 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(553314, 55533, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny and good.</td>', 'Funny and good.', '2004-01-22 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(553316, 56158, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like it because it is a different take on a common sign. Only works, although, because of angle of view.</td>', 'I like it because it is a different take on a common sign. Only works, although, because of angle of view.', '2004-01-22 11:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553321, 56070, 7628, '<td valign="top">This feels a bit too much of a snap shot, not planned or composed.  It is nicely lit and the colors are vivid.  There are just to many subjects scattered about - I don''t know what to focus on - the white car?  the black car?  The building? The truck? Perhaps if you let the shuttere open a long time and got the blur of cars going past that would carry more of a "California" message - cars constantly going from here to there?  Or made the back drop o the sign just the lovely trees and sky - a message to californians -"Stop and enjoy this lovely place you live"....</td>', 'This feels a bit too much of a snap shot, not planned or composed.  It is nicely lit and the colors are vivid.  There are just to many subjects scattered about - I don''t know what to focus on - the white car?  the black car?  The building? The truck? Perhaps if you let the shuttere open a long time and got the blur of cars going past that would carry more of a "California" message - cars constantly going from here to there?  Or made the back drop o the sign just the lovely trees and sky - a message to californians -"Stop and enjoy this lovely place you live"....', '2004-01-22 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(553324, 55446, 11793, '<td valign="top">road signs.....</td>', 'road signs.....', '2004-01-22 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(553327, 56069, 16402, '<td valign="top">Other than the name, I''m not sure what the connection to road signs is. Still, I like the textures and tone of the photo.</td>', 'Other than the name, I''m not sure what the connection to road signs is. Still, I like the textures and tone of the photo.', '2004-01-22 11:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(553328, 55913, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the relection (the intverted bit works well) the trees on one side the sign on the other.  I like the horizontal composition, the b&amp;w simplfies it and allow the glasses frame to frame the picture.  Nice tones and range.  Good work with the focus too.  Looking close I realize you can see her eyelashes and eye a bit through the lense, make it look like she is looking out of the sky.  I only wish for a bit more "meaningful" title.  9</td>', 'I like the relection (the intverted bit works well) the trees on one side the sign on the other.  I like the horizontal composition, the b&w simplfies it and allow the glasses frame to frame the picture.  Nice tones and range.  Good work with the focus too.  Looking close I realize you can see her eyelashes and eye a bit through the lense, make it look like she is looking out of the sky.  I only wish for a bit more "meaningful" title.  9', '2004-01-22 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(553331, 56108, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very little creativity here. Photo is out of focus, grainy and should have at least been straightened.</td>', 'Very little creativity here. Photo is out of focus, grainy and should have at least been straightened.', '2004-01-22 11:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553332, 55886, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hear! Hear!  Happy b-day MLK! I like your creative angle - almost like the sign is reaching down to touch us.  The lighting could be better - hard to get it right with the bright sky behind - a flash might reflect off the sign nicely?</td>', 'Hear! Hear!  Happy b-day MLK! I like your creative angle - almost like the sign is reaching down to touch us.  The lighting could be better - hard to get it right with the bright sky behind - a flash might reflect off the sign nicely?', '2004-01-22 11:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(553335, 55835, 12151, '<td valign="top">I\''d really like to know where you founf this sign - a novelty shop?  Nice job with the photo, though; it makes you pause (ironically..).  In terms of composition, I do find it weird that it''s behind the fence.</td>', 'I\''d really like to know where you founf this sign - a novelty shop?  Nice job with the photo, though; it makes you pause (ironically..).  In terms of composition, I do find it weird that it''s behind the fence.', '2004-01-22 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(553338, 56100, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very rustic - I like how the red of some signs is repeated in the sky.  The bare trees make a nice backdrop.  Wish the houses and telephone lines weren''t there, it would be so much more powerful without them.  The lighting is nice - feels natural and glowing like the setting sun.</td>', 'Very rustic - I like how the red of some signs is repeated in the sky.  The bare trees make a nice backdrop.  Wish the houses and telephone lines weren''t there, it would be so much more powerful without them.  The lighting is nice - feels natural and glowing like the setting sun.', '2004-01-22 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553340, 55648, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Glad my address isn''t  "Dull Rd."  It is a nice idea - those thick blank clouds, and -pop- at the bottom the green sign.  Still, I''m made curious what is beneath the sign.</td>', 'Funny.  Glad my address isn''t  "Dull Rd."  It is a nice idea - those thick blank clouds, and -pop- at the bottom the green sign.  Still, I''m made curious what is beneath the sign.', '2004-01-22 11:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(553344, 55986, 7628, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice slice of life.  A lovely composition of a perplexing spot.  Makes the view shake their head and smile.</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice slice of life.  A lovely composition of a perplexing spot.  Makes the view shake their head and smile.', '2004-01-22 11:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(553349, 55937, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  You''ve come in close enough to make up see the things we never notice tho we''d drive by the sign every day.  Yet you''ve included enough of the sign that it is ovious what it is.</td>', 'Great detail.  You''ve come in close enough to make up see the things we never notice tho we''d drive by the sign every day.  Yet you''ve included enough of the sign that it is ovious what it is.', '2004-01-22 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(553353, 55331, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice old feel with the color.  Wish you''d included more of the tracks and bottom of the sign or cropped the out entirely.  Nice textures, very different feel than all the bright and glaring modern roadsigns.</td>', 'Nice old feel with the color.  Wish you''d included more of the tracks and bottom of the sign or cropped the out entirely.  Nice textures, very different feel than all the bright and glaring modern roadsigns.', '2004-01-22 11:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(553354, 55835, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice ! I like the irony.</td>', 'Nice ! I like the irony.', '2004-01-22 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(553355, 55623, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing!</td>', 'Interesting framing!', '2004-01-22 11:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(553357, 55935, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice action, good composition.  I like how the sign glows in the darkness and the train zooms at us.  The diagonals work very nicely.</td>', 'Nice action, good composition.  I like how the sign glows in the darkness and the train zooms at us.  The diagonals work very nicely.', '2004-01-22 11:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(553358, 55521, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Morbid perhaps!</td>', 'Interesting concept. Morbid perhaps!', '2004-01-22 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(553359, 56158, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice close up!</td>', 'Nice close up!', '2004-01-22 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(553361, 55881, 14836, '<td valign="top">A bit more color would have helped!</td>', 'A bit more color would have helped!', '2004-01-22 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(553362, 55460, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting perpective. I like the lines in all directions!</td>', 'Interesting perpective. I like the lines in all directions!', '2004-01-22 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553363, 56002, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the comparison between the pointy sign and the row of arches.  I might try cropping at the top and the left - leaving just two arches and losing the line of the builing second story.  Pulls the composition together a bit more.  The colors and the textue after the rain are lovely.</td>', 'I like the comparison between the pointy sign and the row of arches.  I might try cropping at the top and the left - leaving just two arches and losing the line of the builing second story.  Pulls the composition together a bit more.  The colors and the textue after the rain are lovely.', '2004-01-22 11:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(553364, 55334, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I wonder if using force flash would have helped with the sign ?</td>', 'Nice shot! I wonder if using force flash would have helped with the sign ?', '2004-01-22 11:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(553366, 56058, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Sharp contrast !</td>', 'Nice idea. Sharp contrast !', '2004-01-22 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553368, 56051, 7628, '<td valign="top">How nice!  All roads lead to Milan?  No matter which way you go you''ll get there in 50km.  The composition is a bit cluttered, and I might not look at the details without the title.  Perhaps cropping in on both sides would draw the eye to the sign better?</td>', 'How nice!  All roads lead to Milan?  No matter which way you go you''ll get there in 50km.  The composition is a bit cluttered, and I might not look at the details without the title.  Perhaps cropping in on both sides would draw the eye to the sign better?', '2004-01-22 11:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(553369, 55921, 14509, '<td valign="top">Great original idea. Well seen. Ideal for black and white.  Well done.</td>', 'Great original idea. Well seen. Ideal for black and white.  Well done.', '2004-01-22 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553370, 56073, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting detail - almost Escher-like. creative idea, but still seems out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting detail - almost Escher-like. creative idea, but still seems out of focus.', '2004-01-22 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(553372, 56085, 14509, '<td valign="top">A pleasure to see something other than road signs. Very original idea, and good timing with the train passing through.  A good dramatic shot. Well done.</td>', 'A pleasure to see something other than road signs. Very original idea, and good timing with the train passing through.  A good dramatic shot. Well done.', '2004-01-22 11:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(553373, 56136, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny and fun.  Wish the sign were better lit - those shadows are distracting.  Wish you could have gotten in closer so you didn''t need to crop and lose resolution.</td>', 'Funny and fun.  Wish the sign were better lit - those shadows are distracting.  Wish you could have gotten in closer so you didn''t need to crop and lose resolution.', '2004-01-22 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(553375, 56053, 14509, '<td valign="top">Well seen.</td>', 'Well seen.', '2004-01-22 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(553378, 55236, 7628, '<td valign="top">Creative. I''ve never looked at a walk sign this closely.  Perhaps a bit too simple?  Some more context?  Perhaps a bit of motion in the camera to make the walking man look like he''s moving?</td>', 'Creative. I''ve never looked at a walk sign this closely.  Perhaps a bit too simple?  Some more context?  Perhaps a bit of motion in the camera to make the walking man look like he''s moving?', '2004-01-22 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(553379, 55625, 14509, '<td valign="top">This is rather a unique post processing technique photo. Not sure how you did it, but it really does make the signs prominent.</td>', 'This is rather a unique post processing technique photo. Not sure how you did it, but it really does make the signs prominent.', '2004-01-22 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(553381, 55963, 14509, '<td valign="top">Nice and original, showing many, many signs. Well done.</td>', 'Nice and original, showing many, many signs. Well done.', '2004-01-22 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(553382, 55586, 7628, '<td valign="top">So lovely!  The fluid clouds and the curves in the sign work well together.  The stark grasses poppong out against the clouds are great contrast.  The dark hill tops in the foreground, the lighter ones on the horizon makes a nice progression.  Wish there wasn;t any glare on the sign. 9</td>', 'So lovely!  The fluid clouds and the curves in the sign work well together.  The stark grasses poppong out against the clouds are great contrast.  The dark hill tops in the foreground, the lighter ones on the horizon makes a nice progression.  Wish there wasn;t any glare on the sign. 9', '2004-01-22 11:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553383, 56081, 14509, '<td valign="top">Rather pleasing winding road. Love the autumn colours you have captured here. <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Rather pleasing winding road. Love the autumn colours you have captured here. Well done.', '2004-01-22 11:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(553387, 55986, 14509, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Like the angle in which you have taken the shot.</td>', 'Very good composition. Like the angle in which you have taken the shot.', '2004-01-22 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(553389, 55433, 14509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-01-22 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(553390, 55679, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very vivid red, lovely gradient of blues.  Nice! 9</td>', 'Very vivid red, lovely gradient of blues.  Nice! 9', '2004-01-22 11:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(553392, 55333, 14509, '<td valign="top">Very graphic shot. Oblongs, squares, diagonal lines, texture, and arrows. Well composed, and a great original shot.</td>', 'Very graphic shot. Oblongs, squares, diagonal lines, texture, and arrows. Well composed, and a great original shot.', '2004-01-22 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(553393, 56114, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the silouetted grasses, the line of yellow diamonds that follow the horizon and the directions of the taller sign.  Great clouds, color. 8</td>', 'I like the silouetted grasses, the line of yellow diamonds that follow the horizon and the directions of the taller sign.  Great clouds, color. 8', '2004-01-22 11:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(553394, 55433, 13336, '<td valign="top">great composition!  nice cropping and use of negative space, the angle on the sign where the horse head comes in is perfect.  great perspective.  DOF is nice.<br/> <br/>if the horse had been real, this would easily be a nine or a ten.</td>', 'great composition!  nice cropping and use of negative space, the angle on the sign where the horse head comes in is perfect.  great perspective.  DOF is nice. if the horse had been real, this would easily be a nine or a ten.', '2004-01-22 11:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(553398, 55835, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the message!  The shape and color and a stop sign, barred behing a wire fence, and still is says GO!  Thats the spirit.</td>', 'I like the message!  The shape and color and a stop sign, barred behing a wire fence, and still is says GO!  Thats the spirit.', '2004-01-22 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
