(553904, 55773, 11769, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the lady sitting there staring right at the camera. Nice.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the lady sitting there staring right at the camera. Nice.', '2004-01-22 18:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(553905, 55999, 11769, '<td valign="top">HAHA Funny pic. Nicely composed.</td>', 'HAHA Funny pic. Nicely composed.', '2004-01-22 18:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(553907, 55886, 11769, '<td valign="top">HAHA Funny pic. Nicely composed.</td>', 'HAHA Funny pic. Nicely composed.', '2004-01-22 18:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(553971, 56122, 2792, '<td valign="top">Not that confusing. =-) A little tightly cropped around the bottom.</td>', 'Not that confusing. =-) A little tightly cropped around the bottom.', '2004-01-22 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(553986, 56050, 2792, '<td valign="top">Neat signs, needs better lighting however. =-)</td>', 'Neat signs, needs better lighting however. =-)', '2004-01-22 19:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(553987, 55731, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2004-01-22 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(553989, 55678, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is the best presentation of a stop sign that I''ve seen so far.  The angle, shadows, and color contrasts make the photo.</td>', 'This is the best presentation of a stop sign that I''ve seen so far.  The angle, shadows, and color contrasts make the photo.', '2004-01-22 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(553992, 55913, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting-looking photo.</td>', 'This is an interesting-looking photo.', '2004-01-22 19:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(554000, 55530, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice abstract photo that''s better technically than most the other photos (abstract or otherwise).  It lacks a slight amount of "wow"-factor though.</td>', 'This is a very nice abstract photo that''s better technically than most the other photos (abstract or otherwise).  It lacks a slight amount of "wow"-factor though.', '2004-01-22 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(554002, 55433, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a well-crafted photo, like a drawing, almost.</td>', 'This is a well-crafted photo, like a drawing, almost.', '2004-01-22 19:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(554003, 55511, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is another on of htose photos that makes you pause - nice job.</td>', 'This is another on of htose photos that makes you pause - nice job.', '2004-01-22 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(554012, 55648, 12151, '<td valign="top">Witty photo that has the look to pull it off.  Good job.  This is one of the few photos here where a bright and obviously placed sign sticks out in an appealing way, not in an obstrusive or annoying way!  It suggests sarcastic commentary to me, which is excellent.  Good sarcastic photos are hard to come by.</td>', 'Witty photo that has the look to pull it off.  Good job.  This is one of the few photos here where a bright and obviously placed sign sticks out in an appealing way, not in an obstrusive or annoying way!  It suggests sarcastic commentary to me, which is excellent.  Good sarcastic photos are hard to come by.', '2004-01-22 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(554013, 56015, 2158, '<td valign="top">To me those bags of garbage detract from what would have been a really attractive shot.</td>', 'To me those bags of garbage detract from what would have been a really attractive shot.', '2004-01-22 20:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(554014, 56017, 12151, '<td valign="top">The grittiness of your textures are unique, and your color/geometry composition is very good.  Even your border was chosen nicely.  This is a photo that I would want to see blown up more to fine detail, because even though it looks so simple from far away, there are all these little shapes and nicks visible up close.  Assuming it''s very sharp at high resolution, I wouldn''t change very much about this photo.</td>', 'The grittiness of your textures are unique, and your color/geometry composition is very good.  Even your border was chosen nicely.  This is a photo that I would want to see blown up more to fine detail, because even though it looks so simple from far away, there are all these little shapes and nicks visible up close.  Assuming it''s very sharp at high resolution, I wouldn''t change very much about this photo.', '2004-01-22 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(554015, 56135, 12151, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured very nice, bold contrasts.  In my personal taste I like this, although I can see how it wouldn''t be for everyone.  Stick to your own judgment when it comes to what style works in your photos at any given time..</td>', 'You''ve captured very nice, bold contrasts.  In my personal taste I like this, although I can see how it wouldn''t be for everyone.  Stick to your own judgment when it comes to what style works in your photos at any given time..', '2004-01-22 20:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(554024, 56110, 15197, '<td valign="top">I like the whole concept.  I just don''t like the color.</td>', 'I like the whole concept.  I just don''t like the color.', '2004-01-22 20:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(554025, 55623, 15197, '<td valign="top">nice bright red, angle doesn''t work for me</td>', 'nice bright red, angle doesn''t work for me', '2004-01-22 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(554026, 56093, 15197, '<td valign="top">The car is a distraction, but I like the person in the picture.</td>', 'The car is a distraction, but I like the person in the picture.', '2004-01-22 20:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
