(554029, 55704, 15197, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I would have not put the sign dead center.  Mayb try a few different angles with the sun on water.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I would have not put the sign dead center.  Mayb try a few different angles with the sun on water.', '2004-01-22 20:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
