(554066, 56015, 7556, '<td valign="top">It would be a nicer picture without the trash bags...I like the car lights zooming past and the sign is interesting...</td>', 'It would be a nicer picture without the trash bags...I like the car lights zooming past and the sign is interesting...', '2004-01-22 21:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(554067, 55512, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems a bit dark.</td>', 'seems a bit dark.', '2004-01-22 21:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(554068, 56017, 6668, '<td valign="top">The black specs in the white are distracting, overal nice shot.</td>', 'The black specs in the white are distracting, overal nice shot.', '2004-01-22 21:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(554069, 55894, 7556, '<td valign="top">That''s funny!...lol</td>', 'That''s funny!...lol', '2004-01-22 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(554070, 55623, 7556, '<td valign="top">Hey it''s another stop sign!  This one caught my eye, I like the slanted angle and the trees with the touch of orange color along with the bright red sign, nice job...</td>', 'Hey it''s another stop sign!  This one caught my eye, I like the slanted angle and the trees with the touch of orange color along with the bright red sign, nice job...', '2004-01-22 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(554074, 55518, 7556, '<td valign="top">Hey, where is the sign that said "Road Dangerous When Under Water" from the previous challenge? LOL This looks like it needs to go here...Cool shot...</td>', 'Hey, where is the sign that said "Road Dangerous When Under Water" from the previous challenge? LOL This looks like it needs to go here...Cool shot...', '2004-01-22 21:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(554075, 55679, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great capture, hope to see this one in the top three. 10</td>', 'Great capture, hope to see this one in the top three. 10', '2004-01-22 21:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(554076, 55419, 7556, '<td valign="top">Red light and Green light...your choice...How many accidents at this intersection?</td>', 'Red light and Green light...your choice...How many accidents at this intersection?', '2004-01-22 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(554084, 55521, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  The painted sign is not esthetically pleaseing.  The explosion is interesting, but distracting.   I would do this as a non challenge type photo, use layers and leave the color in.  I personally don''t care to be reminded of 9/11.</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  The painted sign is not esthetically pleaseing.  The explosion is interesting, but distracting.   I would do this as a non challenge type photo, use layers and leave the color in.  I personally don''t care to be reminded of 9/11.', '2004-01-22 22:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(554098, 55586, 7556, '<td valign="top">I like the clouds and the monochrome treatment, very nice...</td>', 'I like the clouds and the monochrome treatment, very nice...', '2004-01-22 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(554114, 55731, 16089, '<td valign="top">Great angle. 5</td>', 'Great angle. 5', '2004-01-22 23:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(554116, 56135, 16089, '<td valign="top">An optical illusion. Good.</td>', 'An optical illusion. Good.', '2004-01-22 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(554118, 55473, 16089, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with road signs?</td>', 'What does this have to do with road signs?', '2004-01-22 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(554176, 55648, 7935, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space and the green contrast really makes the pic  only thing wrong is it''s a bit grainy.</td>', 'great use of negative space and the green contrast really makes the pic  only thing wrong is it''s a bit grainy.', '2004-01-23 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(554216, 56110, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-01-23 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(554220, 55535, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-01-23 02:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554221, 55942, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely and good.</td>', 'Lovely and good.', '2004-01-23 02:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(554250, 55333, 13735, '<td valign="top">Masterly!<br/>The grain of both the pavement and the road is so expressive!<br/>Bravo!</td>', 'Masterly!The grain of both the pavement and the road is so expressive!Bravo!', '2004-01-23 04:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(554251, 55890, 13735, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe how good it is!!! Both the idea and the composition... to say nothing about the atmosphere!</td>', 'I can''t believe how good it is!!! Both the idea and the composition... to say nothing about the atmosphere!', '2004-01-23 04:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(554252, 56135, 13735, '<td valign="top">So simple, but impressive! Nice cut!</td>', 'So simple, but impressive! Nice cut!', '2004-01-23 04:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(554253, 55546, 13735, '<td valign="top">Excellent "title-pic match"! And idea as well! Bravo!</td>', 'Excellent "title-pic match"! And idea as well! Bravo!', '2004-01-23 04:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(554254, 55530, 13735, '<td valign="top">What a nice correlation... and icy cold sky behind! I like it very much!</td>', 'What a nice correlation... and icy cold sky behind! I like it very much!', '2004-01-23 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(554256, 55648, 13735, '<td valign="top">"Dull" but at least 9 for me! Bravo!</td>', '"Dull" but at least 9 for me! Bravo!', '2004-01-23 04:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(554258, 56085, 13735, '<td valign="top">If only the waggon was motion-blurred instead of "shaken" blinking light!</td>', 'If only the waggon was motion-blurred instead of "shaken" blinking light!', '2004-01-23 04:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(554259, 55962, 13735, '<td valign="top">Nice metaphor! So simple... and good!</td>', 'Nice metaphor! So simple... and good!', '2004-01-23 04:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554260, 55742, 16046, '<td valign="top">This is my #1 pick, great job, lights are in sync with the sign.</td>', 'This is my #1 pick, great job, lights are in sync with the sign.', '2004-01-23 04:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(554261, 55586, 16046, '<td valign="top">This is my # 2 vote, great fog.</td>', 'This is my # 2 vote, great fog.', '2004-01-23 04:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(554262, 55530, 16046, '<td valign="top">This is my #3 vote, great contrast between sign and building.</td>', 'This is my #3 vote, great contrast between sign and building.', '2004-01-23 05:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(554272, 55569, 3087, '<td valign="top">The low viewpoint, unusual angle/ composition, interesting diagionals and strong use of colour all combine to make this one of my favourite entries in this challenge.</td>', 'The low viewpoint, unusual angle/ composition, interesting diagionals and strong use of colour all combine to make this one of my favourite entries in this challenge.', '2004-01-23 05:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(554273, 55333, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition, great use of repetition and diagonals. Nice shadows. Strong image.</td>', 'Very strong composition, great use of repetition and diagonals. Nice shadows. Strong image.', '2004-01-23 05:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(554275, 55742, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the idea very much - mirroring the sign with the light trail is very clever. I think overall composition is a little weak and there are too many distracting items in the background. A similar idea on a less cluttered patch of road would have been even stronger.</td>', 'I like the idea very much - mirroring the sign with the light trail is very clever. I think overall composition is a little weak and there are too many distracting items in the background. A similar idea on a less cluttered patch of road would have been even stronger.', '2004-01-23 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(554276, 55586, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of black and white with toning to bring out the clouds.</td>', 'Nice choice of black and white with toning to bring out the clouds.', '2004-01-23 05:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(554277, 55236, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute close up of something we usually only look at from a little more distance. Feels a little too closely cropped within the frame.</td>', 'Cute close up of something we usually only look at from a little more distance. Feels a little too closely cropped within the frame.', '2004-01-23 05:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(554278, 55836, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way this suggests confusion/ conflicting messages. Nice choice of black and white.</td>', 'I like the way this suggests confusion/ conflicting messages. Nice choice of black and white.', '2004-01-23 05:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(554279, 55890, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that I''d say this represents a road sign so much as the absence of one but I think the image itself is very striking indeed. Great composition in terms of rule of thirds height of city and cloud and pole add wonderful compositional balance as well as visual interest. Black and white works very well.</td>', 'I don''t know that I''d say this represents a road sign so much as the absence of one but I think the image itself is very striking indeed. Great composition in terms of rule of thirds height of city and cloud and pole add wonderful compositional balance as well as visual interest. Black and white works very well.', '2004-01-23 05:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(554280, 56069, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the only one who will comment on the phallic nature of this image nor fail to understand how it ties in to the challenge theme. However I do like the image - the texture you''ve captured is fascinating.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the only one who will comment on the phallic nature of this image nor fail to understand how it ties in to the challenge theme. However I do like the image - the texture you''ve captured is fascinating.', '2004-01-23 05:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(554282, 56015, 3087, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect to like this, from the thumbnail, but that''s why I pay little heed to thumbnails...<br/> <br/>I really like the way the rubbish bags add a certain mood to the image. Composition feels well balanced to me.</td>', 'I didn''t expect to like this, from the thumbnail, but that''s why I pay little heed to thumbnails... I really like the way the rubbish bags add a certain mood to the image. Composition feels well balanced to me.', '2004-01-23 05:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(554283, 55530, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shapes and colours - what a vibrant image! Well composed in terms of viewpoint, balance of building to sky and position of sign.</td>', 'Wonderful shapes and colours - what a vibrant image! Well composed in terms of viewpoint, balance of building to sky and position of sign.', '2004-01-23 05:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554295, 55393, 13368, '<td valign="top">Well, it must be quite an old sign: Jugoslavia doesn''t exist anymore as a State:-)))) Very nice tittle you chose.</td>', 'Well, it must be quite an old sign: Jugoslavia doesn''t exist anymore as a State:-)))) Very nice tittle you chose.', '2004-01-23 06:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554312, 55473, 15073, '<td valign="top">where''s the road sign?</td>', 'where''s the road sign?', '2004-01-23 07:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(554313, 56076, 15073, '<td valign="top">where''s the road sign?</td>', 'where''s the road sign?', '2004-01-23 07:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(554323, 55632, 11467, '<td valign="top">Funny sign,!! Not sure if I like the grainy effect so much</td>', 'Funny sign,!! Not sure if I like the grainy effect so much', '2004-01-23 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(554324, 55407, 11467, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours!!!</td>', 'Amazing colours!!!', '2004-01-23 08:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(554325, 55670, 11467, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, maybe a bit too much black in the image. Not sure if it would have looked better at dusk.</td>', 'Like the composition, maybe a bit too much black in the image. Not sure if it would have looked better at dusk.', '2004-01-23 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
