(555384, 56093, 11895, '<td valign="top">good title, gave me a chuckle</td>', 'good title, gave me a chuckle', '2004-01-24 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(555387, 55972, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good; interesting sign. Who would''ve thought to make that into a sign?  :)<br/> <br/>Bad: This needs to be cropped because there is too much space around the sign. The small coke can doesn''t help either. Also would have been better if the background was blurred (DOF).<br/> <br/>Overall pretty interesting. The sign''s subject matter is saving the entry.</td>', 'Good; interesting sign. Who would''ve thought to make that into a sign?  :) Bad: This needs to be cropped because there is too much space around the sign. The small coke can doesn''t help either. Also would have been better if the background was blurred (DOF). Overall pretty interesting. The sign''s subject matter is saving the entry.', '2004-01-24 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(555388, 55806, 8054, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better with the right side cropped all the way up to the road sign. The light on the left is sufficient, IMO. Great subject matter for the challenge!</td>', 'I would have liked it better with the right side cropped all the way up to the road sign. The light on the left is sufficient, IMO. Great subject matter for the challenge!', '2004-01-24 13:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(555389, 55942, 10833, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better shot if the sign was more prominent.  As it is, people may miss it - which is a shame.  It''s a well done, quirky, original shot, in my opinion. I give it a 9</td>', 'I think this would be better shot if the sign was more prominent.  As it is, people may miss it - which is a shame.  It''s a well done, quirky, original shot, in my opinion. I give it a 9', '2004-01-24 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(555390, 55959, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great composition and feel. I like how the sign looks as if it was removed from its previous location (burn marks).</td>', 'Great composition and feel. I like how the sign looks as if it was removed from its previous location (burn marks).', '2004-01-24 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(555393, 55886, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle used in this photograph. Is the sign lettering really that darker gray? I ask because it looks a bit underexposed. Good overall image.</td>', 'Interesting angle used in this photograph. Is the sign lettering really that darker gray? I ask because it looks a bit underexposed. Good overall image.', '2004-01-24 13:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(555394, 55389, 8054, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this one. All the chevrons and the blurred taillights/headlights are a nice touch! Excellent job! 10!</td>', 'Wow, I really like this one. All the chevrons and the blurred taillights/headlights are a nice touch! Excellent job! 10!', '2004-01-24 13:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(555395, 56077, 10833, '<td valign="top">Good Color and perspective.  The bottom background is a bit distracting, but I realize that can''t always be helped :)</td>', 'Good Color and perspective.  The bottom background is a bit distracting, but I realize that can''t always be helped :)', '2004-01-24 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(555396, 55647, 8054, '<td valign="top">I know the hills in the background add a nice touch to the entry but I think you could have cropped the sky a bit closer. And the picture seems a bit washed out. Adjusting the levels would help in this situation to add more contrast and reduce the effects of haze.</td>', 'I know the hills in the background add a nice touch to the entry but I think you could have cropped the sky a bit closer. And the picture seems a bit washed out. Adjusting the levels would help in this situation to add more contrast and reduce the effects of haze.', '2004-01-24 13:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555398, 56090, 8054, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a common approach to the railroad sign. I think it would be more interesting if it was taken from the side or almost any other angle. However, there is good detail and excellent focus. I like the sky background, as well, since it is not distracting.</td>', 'This seems to be a common approach to the railroad sign. I think it would be more interesting if it was taken from the side or almost any other angle. However, there is good detail and excellent focus. I like the sky background, as well, since it is not distracting.', '2004-01-24 13:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(555404, 56060, 8054, '<td valign="top">LOL! This reminds me of an intersection near me. It has a traffic light and a sign right in front of it that says "NO STOPPING AT ANY TIME".  :) Great humor! The only faults I find (minor) are compression (I can see it in the sky) and cropping (I would have cropped a bit more off the bottom).</td>', 'LOL! This reminds me of an intersection near me. It has a traffic light and a sign right in front of it that says "NO STOPPING AT ANY TIME".  :) Great humor! The only faults I find (minor) are compression (I can see it in the sky) and cropping (I would have cropped a bit more off the bottom).', '2004-01-24 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555406, 55999, 8054, '<td valign="top">LOLOL! This is hilarious! The only fault I have with this is the background. I would have used a shallow DOF to concentrate on the sign. 9.</td>', 'LOLOL! This is hilarious! The only fault I have with this is the background. I would have used a shallow DOF to concentrate on the sign. 9.', '2004-01-24 13:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(555407, 55928, 11895, '<td valign="top">seems to need more contrast</td>', 'seems to need more contrast', '2004-01-24 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(555409, 55873, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Blurred car lights is also excellent. I have one complaint and that''s with the lens flare around the street light. It looks like there was a small drop of water which cause the extra flare on the immediate left of the light. Other than that, excellent job! 9.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Blurred car lights is also excellent. I have one complaint and that''s with the lens flare around the street light. It looks like there was a small drop of water which cause the extra flare on the immediate left of the light. Other than that, excellent job! 9.', '2004-01-24 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(555412, 55512, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great overall image! I like the clouds and the sky. The sign is interesting however it looks a bit under exposed. Not sure if it was possible but maybe crop the bottom a bit closer to eliminate the annoying street lights and maybe the hill.</td>', 'Great overall image! I like the clouds and the sky. The sign is interesting however it looks a bit under exposed. Not sure if it was possible but maybe crop the bottom a bit closer to eliminate the annoying street lights and maybe the hill.', '2004-01-24 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(555413, 55928, 8054, '<td valign="top">Image seems washed out and there is excessive blue.</td>', 'Image seems washed out and there is excessive blue.', '2004-01-24 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(555415, 55693, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge! This entry needs to be cropped a little off the top and to the right of the sign. The ground seems a bit bright. Good focus and detail, however.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge! This entry needs to be cropped a little off the top and to the right of the sign. The ground seems a bit bright. Good focus and detail, however.', '2004-01-24 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(555444, 56157, 7152, '<td valign="top">hahhaha .... This is a hilarious sign .. good title.</td>', 'hahhaha .... This is a hilarious sign .. good title.', '2004-01-24 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(555447, 55586, 7152, '<td valign="top">amazing shot</td>', 'amazing shot', '2004-01-24 15:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(555448, 55972, 3540, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast in this photo.  It sure makes that sign stand out.  The darkness all around and the silhouettes of the trees make for a good backdrop for this kind of shot and really emphasize mood and theme.  Nice job 7</td>', 'Strong contrast in this photo.  It sure makes that sign stand out.  The darkness all around and the silhouettes of the trees make for a good backdrop for this kind of shot and really emphasize mood and theme.  Nice job 7', '2004-01-24 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(555451, 55999, 3540, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Beatles classic, "Why don''t we do it in the Road"  Very funny with the title.  The photo is pretty plain, but then again so are most of them.  6 for giggles</td>', 'Reminds me of the Beatles classic, "Why don''t we do it in the Road"  Very funny with the title.  The photo is pretty plain, but then again so are most of them.  6 for giggles', '2004-01-24 15:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(555454, 56135, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... Have you won a lot of ribbons?  This just has that kind of feel.  I know this feeling too, of something familiar even if you don''t know what it is.  Its classic.  Great feel.  I like the lines and shapes.   Maybe I''m way off? 9</td>', 'Hmmmm... Have you won a lot of ribbons?  This just has that kind of feel.  I know this feeling too, of something familiar even if you don''t know what it is.  Its classic.  Great feel.  I like the lines and shapes.   Maybe I''m way off? 9', '2004-01-24 15:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
