(555466, 55942, 3540, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones I''ve seen.  Good colors.  The shadows are just a little heavy.  I like the color saturation, but I think a little more exposure would''ve done you well for this shot.  Good work 8</td>', 'One of the better ones I''ve seen.  Good colors.  The shadows are just a little heavy.  I like the color saturation, but I think a little more exposure would''ve done you well for this shot.  Good work 8', '2004-01-24 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
