(555691, 55768, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the B&amp;W. It does seem to be tilting a bit down to the right. I can see the trees in the back are ok, but it''s just slightly off. Doesn''t matter anyway. It''s great.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the B&W. It does seem to be tilting a bit down to the right. I can see the trees in the back are ok, but it''s just slightly off. Doesn''t matter anyway. It''s great.', '2004-01-24 22:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(555692, 55602, 15540, '<td valign="top">It just doesn''t appeal to me .... sorry.</td>', 'It just doesn''t appeal to me .... sorry.', '2004-01-24 22:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555693, 55873, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great idea with the lights running the back making it look like speeding. The light overhead is a little distracting. Maybe crop the whole sign just above the 35 number. It''s good on focus too.</td>', 'Great idea with the lights running the back making it look like speeding. The light overhead is a little distracting. Maybe crop the whole sign just above the 35 number. It''s good on focus too.', '2004-01-24 22:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
