(555696, 56070, 15540, '<td valign="top">A little drab, sorry. The other objects in the picture are more of the subject than the sign. It''s good lighting and focus though.</td>', 'A little drab, sorry. The other objects in the picture are more of the subject than the sign. It''s good lighting and focus though.', '2004-01-24 22:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
