(555892, 55514, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great sign - good sharpness and contrast.  The diagonal helps strengthen it as well.  good work.</td>', 'Great sign - good sharpness and contrast.  The diagonal helps strengthen it as well.  good work.', '2004-01-25 02:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
