(557980, 56052, 11321, '<td valign="top">Lighting and background are good but IMHO it need more DOF because the front is too blurry.<br/>The top of the book is in focus but you have there less light (it is dartker) than the bottom of the book (out of focus part)<br/>If the top of the book would be brighter and the bottom would be darker maybe then the current DOF works well.</td>', 'Lighting and background are good but IMHO it need more DOF because the front is too blurry.The top of the book is in focus but you have there less light (it is dartker) than the bottom of the book (out of focus part)If the top of the book would be brighter and the bottom would be darker maybe then the current DOF works well.', '2004-01-26 15:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(557983, 55491, 11321, '<td valign="top">great angle!<br/></td>', 'great angle!', '2004-01-26 15:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(557994, 55632, 15475, '<td valign="top">Woo~ a bit x-files''ish!  Nice and spooky...  I love the bright red sky and the blue tint on the sign to enhance the eeriness.  I''d definately drive carefully!</td>', 'Woo~ a bit x-files''ish!  Nice and spooky...  I love the bright red sky and the blue tint on the sign to enhance the eeriness.  I''d definately drive carefully!', '2004-01-26 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(558001, 56110, 16607, '<td valign="top">nice photo...<br/></td>', 'nice photo...', '2004-01-26 15:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(558016, 55613, 15475, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked the wooden signs better than the conventional metal signs.  Nice picture!</td>', 'I''ve always liked the wooden signs better than the conventional metal signs.  Nice picture!', '2004-01-26 16:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(558023, 55533, 15475, '<td valign="top">Yap, this is for me!  A big "huh?"  It''s like:  dumb people go this way!  Very nice picture!  Nice and clear too!</td>', 'Yap, this is for me!  A big "huh?"  It''s like:  dumb people go this way!  Very nice picture!  Nice and clear too!', '2004-01-26 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(558063, 56122, 15475, '<td valign="top">..."And if and only if X = Y and Y = Z, then you can turn left"   I know, confusing isn''t it?  I like this picture!  Very clear, very sharp!</td>', '..."And if and only if X = Y and Y = Z, then you can turn left"   I know, confusing isn''t it?  I like this picture!  Very clear, very sharp!', '2004-01-26 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(558071, 56069, 14773, '<td valign="top">I know what this is and that it does fit the challenge, I think the photo could be improved with a less tight crop to show us, who wouldn''t normally see something like this, what it is and where it would be found.</td>', 'I know what this is and that it does fit the challenge, I think the photo could be improved with a less tight crop to show us, who wouldn''t normally see something like this, what it is and where it would be found.', '2004-01-26 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(558092, 55586, 8860, '<td valign="top">You may just find yourself with a blue appendage to this image after the deadline! Very aesthetic and, finally, a challenge shot worth hanging. <br/> <br/>Beautiful tones and lots to look at besides the humour. Just a tiny bit more ground would have helped with a touch less sky. My only [10]</td>', 'You may just find yourself with a blue appendage to this image after the deadline! Very aesthetic and, finally, a challenge shot worth hanging.  Beautiful tones and lots to look at besides the humour. Just a tiny bit more ground would have helped with a touch less sky. My only [10]', '2004-01-26 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(558093, 55937, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition and view of texture in this way. Those cracks look like tiny road maps. <br/> <br/>The wonky horizontal lines are slightly distracting though and I yearn for all those to be straight, but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I really like this composition and view of texture in this way. Those cracks look like tiny road maps.  The wonky horizontal lines are slightly distracting though and I yearn for all those to be straight, but it''s a good shot.', '2004-01-26 17:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(558098, 55742, 8860, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Looks like you set this up and it''s worth doing. <br/> <br/>I''d like to have seen the streaks continue into a vehicle in an ideal world - which you could have done if you''d parked the car at its end point for a few secs and reversed during the rest of the exposure. Could have been dangerous though.  ;)<br/> <br/>Shot is a bit skewed clockwise, but it''s a fun, well observed shot.</td>', 'Clever idea. Looks like you set this up and it''s worth doing.  I''d like to have seen the streaks continue into a vehicle in an ideal world - which you could have done if you''d parked the car at its end point for a few secs and reversed during the rest of the exposure. Could have been dangerous though.  ;) Shot is a bit skewed clockwise, but it''s a fun, well observed shot.', '2004-01-26 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(558105, 55856, 8860, '<td valign="top">I sympathise having dull British weather, but you''ve done a good job to get an interesting subject out of it. The scene is gloomily typical of our urban areas and your capture of the cop car is a nice addition of social contrast. I like this a lot. [8]</td>', 'I sympathise having dull British weather, but you''ve done a good job to get an interesting subject out of it. The scene is gloomily typical of our urban areas and your capture of the cop car is a nice addition of social contrast. I like this a lot. [8]', '2004-01-26 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558113, 56121, 8860, '<td valign="top">Surreal looking colour and contrast - nice snap.</td>', 'Surreal looking colour and contrast - nice snap.', '2004-01-26 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(558115, 55733, 8860, '<td valign="top">This new stripey horse must cross the road many times a day to get its own sign.  :)</td>', 'This new stripey horse must cross the road many times a day to get its own sign.  :)', '2004-01-26 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(558127, 55842, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very striking contrast with the gloom. Well composed.</td>', 'Very striking contrast with the gloom. Well composed.', '2004-01-26 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(558134, 55447, 8860, '<td valign="top">Off-centre composition would have made this more pleasing - and I feel that I should read some humour into this, but I''m not sure where. <br/> <br/>Perhaps, if the overgrowth/delapidation is the emphasis here, then you should have taken it closer up, viewed from the ground, and lost the distracting context of lake and houses.</td>', 'Off-centre composition would have made this more pleasing - and I feel that I should read some humour into this, but I''m not sure where.  Perhaps, if the overgrowth/delapidation is the emphasis here, then you should have taken it closer up, viewed from the ground, and lost the distracting context of lake and houses.', '2004-01-26 17:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(558143, 56125, 8860, '<td valign="top">Colours are bland, but the concept was quite nice - but it will suffer as an image outside of the challenge (you may grow to dislike it!). There won''t be enough of interest here for most voters as it''s a struggle to find a point of interest. A bit more context of the speed (ie, a pice of vehicle that''s not blurred) would have helped.</td>', 'Colours are bland, but the concept was quite nice - but it will suffer as an image outside of the challenge (you may grow to dislike it!). There won''t be enough of interest here for most voters as it''s a struggle to find a point of interest. A bit more context of the speed (ie, a pice of vehicle that''s not blurred) would have helped.', '2004-01-26 17:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(558151, 55460, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice image of somewhere far away from me! Good DOF and nice use of duotone. If anything, I struggle to find a message, but there may not be one of course.  ;)<br/> <br/>It makes a hangable photo, which I prefer to one that simply wins a ribbon.</td>', 'Nice image of somewhere far away from me! Good DOF and nice use of duotone. If anything, I struggle to find a message, but there may not be one of course.  ;) It makes a hangable photo, which I prefer to one that simply wins a ribbon.', '2004-01-26 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558157, 55473, 8860, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where your roads are but this is a sign to me that you may have driven too far!<br/>Surely, you submitted this by accident? This is ''Road Signs Re-visited''!!  :D<br/> <br/>Nice capture but it''s all a bit out of focus (by the way).</td>', 'I don''t know where your roads are but this is a sign to me that you may have driven too far!Surely, you submitted this by accident? This is ''Road Signs Re-visited''!!  :D Nice capture but it''s all a bit out of focus (by the way).', '2004-01-26 18:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(558167, 56108, 8860, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to shoot a STOP sign, then you ought to try something creative, other than plonking it dead centre and slightly out of focus! Sorry, but not only are there dozens of them, this is uninterestingly shot with quite unpleasant colours.<br/> <br/>An off-centre composition normally helps and a steady hand and sharp focus is essential. Trying to find a reason to relate the word ''STOP'' would help too - like a bird flying past or someone walking perhaps?</td>', 'If you''re going to shoot a STOP sign, then you ought to try something creative, other than plonking it dead centre and slightly out of focus! Sorry, but not only are there dozens of them, this is uninterestingly shot with quite unpleasant colours. An off-centre composition normally helps and a steady hand and sharp focus is essential. Trying to find a reason to relate the word ''STOP'' would help too - like a bird flying past or someone walking perhaps?', '2004-01-26 18:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(558173, 56144, 11294, '<td valign="top">maybe going fully b&amp;w apart from the signs would be stonger as the image is already almost there.</td>', 'maybe going fully b&w apart from the signs would be stonger as the image is already almost there.', '2004-01-26 18:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(558198, 56058, 15475, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and creative!  A bit hard to read upside down... but a nice picture!  I love the rain on the ground!  .ti evol I !!!</td>', 'Very artistic and creative!  A bit hard to read upside down... but a nice picture!  I love the rain on the ground!  .ti evol I !!!', '2004-01-26 18:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(558225, 55533, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen one of those signs before.  They certainly wouldn''t be out of place around here though, there are plenty of dummies around.</td>', 'I''ve never seen one of those signs before.  They certainly wouldn''t be out of place around here though, there are plenty of dummies around.', '2004-01-26 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(558233, 55972, 15242, '<td valign="top">Is that a tail light or a beer can?  The picture is better without it.  Thanks for the translation.</td>', 'Is that a tail light or a beer can?  The picture is better without it.  Thanks for the translation.', '2004-01-26 18:54:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(558257, 56135, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful shot - your control of this exposure is so assured - the over-exposing of the lateral planes here gives an Escher-like optical illusion if one looks for too long - you lose the ability to see the true depth of the image in a confusion of different planes. Only slight draw-back is that it''s more about the wall than the sign, but that''s a minor point in such a good shot. 9</td>', 'Very very beautiful shot - your control of this exposure is so assured - the over-exposing of the lateral planes here gives an Escher-like optical illusion if one looks for too long - you lose the ability to see the true depth of the image in a confusion of different planes. Only slight draw-back is that it''s more about the wall than the sign, but that''s a minor point in such a good shot. 9', '2004-01-26 19:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(558260, 55648, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. The angling of the road-sign bothers me a touch (a very small touch, I should add) - had I taken it, I''d have tried to get a sqauer-on view, to lose the angle of the other arm of the sign at least, and to give a more regular shape to the two visible arms: in a composition this oddly geomatric, that distortion becomes quite important I think. 9</td>', 'Wonderful shot. The angling of the road-sign bothers me a touch (a very small touch, I should add) - had I taken it, I''d have tried to get a sqauer-on view, to lose the angle of the other arm of the sign at least, and to give a more regular shape to the two visible arms: in a composition this oddly geomatric, that distortion becomes quite important I think. 9', '2004-01-26 19:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558262, 56002, 6999, '<td valign="top">An object lesson in walking around with your eyes (properly) open, Monsieur.</td>', 'An object lesson in walking around with your eyes (properly) open, Monsieur.', '2004-01-26 19:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(558268, 55469, 2158, '<td valign="top">Waar het jy hierdie snaakse ding gevind?<br/> <br/>I find the colours a bit flat here and would have preferred it with slight adjustments to the saturation and levels.</td>', 'Waar het jy hierdie snaakse ding gevind? I find the colours a bit flat here and would have preferred it with slight adjustments to the saturation and levels.', '2004-01-26 19:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
