(560015, 55625, 15391, '<td valign="top">the reasons i took the picture this way are because it was raining all the time, i''m way too busy with college applications and school, and i knew this might stand out from all the others....just thought it''ll be interesting to see what people say...thanks for the comments though!!</td>', 'the reasons i took the picture this way are because it was raining all the time, i''m way too busy with college applications and school, and i knew this might stand out from all the others....just thought it''ll be interesting to see what people say...thanks for the comments though!!', '2004-01-28 03:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(560017, 56159, 4927, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even notice the bird until I uploaded the photos to my computer. The other exposures/angles for the shot didn''t turn out that great, so I had to use the one with the bird in it. I didn''t like the composition with it cropped out, so I decided to leave it in. I would have loved to spot edit out the bird, but oh well. As they say, Que sera sera.</td>', 'I didn''t even notice the bird until I uploaded the photos to my computer. The other exposures/angles for the shot didn''t turn out that great, so I had to use the one with the bird in it. I didn''t like the composition with it cropped out, so I decided to leave it in. I would have loved to spot edit out the bird, but oh well. As they say, Que sera sera.', '2004-01-28 03:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
