(561815, 55982, 9160, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GoodEnd:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh, good shoot! Finally someone had the great idea to use the fill flash. The sign receives a bit more light than need, but are great as it are. Only the JPEG artifacts blows you. They are many and fully visible. </i></td></tr></table>What is meant by JPEG artifacts? How do you prevent this?</td>', 'Originally posted by GoodEnd: Oh, good shoot! Finally someone had the great idea to use the fill flash. The sign receives a bit more light than need, but are great as it are. Only the JPEG artifacts blows you. They are many and fully visible. What is meant by JPEG artifacts? How do you prevent this?', '2004-01-29 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(561819, 55530, 4482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Chicagrafo:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gordon:</b></div><hr/><i> I think I''d like this a lot more without the sign! sort of feels like the sign is just ''in the way'' of a great picture, to make it fit the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>    I agree, at the time I voted you with a 9, I knew something was wrong with the picture, but couldn''t find out.  Now I know, sorry pal, but my opinion is that this is an otherwise magnificent picture that happens to have an unfitting traffic sign which made it fit the challenge </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You''re absolutely right! And I capitalised on that! :-) If you look at the "postcard" callenge" I almost have the exact same photo but without the sign... it looks way better. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Chicagrafo: Originally posted by Gordon: I think I''d like this a lot more without the sign! sort of feels like the sign is just ''in the way'' of a great picture, to make it fit the challenge.       I agree, at the time I voted you with a 9, I knew something was wrong with the picture, but couldn''t find out.  Now I know, sorry pal, but my opinion is that this is an otherwise magnificent picture that happens to have an unfitting traffic sign which made it fit the challenge   You''re absolutely right! And I capitalised on that! :-) If you look at the "postcard" callenge" I almost have the exact same photo but without the sign... it looks way better. :-)', '2004-01-29 10:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(561882, 56041, 9407, '<td valign="top">First, i´d like to thank everyone´s comments.<br/>That was my first post and i never imagined that i´ll get a 6 points average.<br/>For those who ask :"Where´s this place?" I´ll say that´s obviously a joke but i´d like to recommend them to come here and enjoy this beautiful country.<br/>Here are some directions :<br/><a href="//www.turgalicia.com/sit/arquitectura_form.asp?ctre=113&amp;cidi=I" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.turgalicia.com/sit/arquitectura_form.asp?ctre=113&amp;cidi=I</a> <br/><a href="//www.turgalicia.es/sit/hotel_form.asp?ctre=3315&amp;cidi=I" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.turgalicia.es/sit/hotel_form.asp?ctre=3315&amp;cidi=I</a> <br/><a href="//www.turgalicia.es/sit/ficha_datos.asp?ctre=121&amp;crec=3444&amp;cidi=I" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.turgalicia.es/sit/ficha_datos.asp?ctre=121&amp;crec=3444&amp;cidi=I</a> <br/><a href="//www.elferrol.info/In_Index.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.elferrol.info/In_Index.htm</a> <br/> <br/>And... much more!! just write me a mail and i´ll give u more directions.<br/> <br/>BYE!!</td>', 'First, i´d like to thank everyone´s comments.That was my first post and i never imagined that i´ll get a 6 points average.For those who ask :"Where´s this place?" I´ll say that´s obviously a joke but i´d like to recommend them to come here and enjoy this beautiful country.Here are some directions ://www.turgalicia.com/sit/arquitectura_form.asp?ctre=113&cidi=I //www.turgalicia.es/sit/hotel_form.asp?ctre=3315&cidi=I //www.turgalicia.es/sit/ficha_datos.asp?ctre=121&crec=3444&cidi=I //www.elferrol.info/In_Index.htm  And... much more!! just write me a mail and i´ll give u more directions. BYE!!', '2004-01-29 11:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
