(567205, 55603, 10084, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the comments. I actually took this shot after I started <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=66034" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread.</a> I would like to thank <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6388" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Pedro</a> for the joking email that he sent that got me to start the tread and thus the shot. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-03 17:03:11.</i></td>', 'Thanks everybody for the comments. I actually took this shot after I started this thread. I would like to thank Pedro for the joking email that he sent that got me to start the tread and thus the shot. ', '2004-02-03 17:00:22.000000', '2004-02-03 17:03:11.000000', 0),
