(599340, 55603, 9906, '<td valign="top">Man, I NOW know I''ve been working to hard.  I totally missed this shot and the whole challenge, now that I think about it!  This is one of the best examples of framing within the shot that I''ve seen in a while!  All the lines in silhouette, if you follow them around, lead to the sunset!<br/> <br/>The only thing that I can find to comment bad about the shot seems to fit into it so naturally that I''m almost afraid to say it.  There''s a light post right in front of the sun but with the pole and transformer on the right border it just seems to fit in.  I get the impression of someone stepping out to take a smoke break, glancing up and seeing...<br/> <br/>And you tell me <i>I''ve</i> come a long way.  Very good shot my friend! [tip hat][/hat tip]</td>', 'Man, I NOW know I''ve been working to hard.  I totally missed this shot and the whole challenge, now that I think about it!  This is one of the best examples of framing within the shot that I''ve seen in a while!  All the lines in silhouette, if you follow them around, lead to the sunset! The only thing that I can find to comment bad about the shot seems to fit into it so naturally that I''m almost afraid to say it.  There''s a light post right in front of the sun but with the pole and transformer on the right border it just seems to fit in.  I get the impression of someone stepping out to take a smoke break, glancing up and seeing... And you tell me I''ve come a long way.  Very good shot my friend! [tip hat][/hat tip]', '2004-02-26 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
