(1481820, 56063, 16488, '<td valign="top">Road Signs was a difficult challenge this time around.  Perhaps it always will be...such static subjects are hard to render with interest.  You knew it wasn''t the best quality image when you entered, so what can I add that would "instruct" you?  Nothing.<br/> <br/>I like signs.  I like signs that make you do a "double take."  Hard to put them in context for sure but you did tickle a number of voters.  Isn''t it nice to know that your concept was one that touched others?<br/> <br/>Thank you for playing "closest to 5" today.</td>', 'Road Signs was a difficult challenge this time around.  Perhaps it always will be...such static subjects are hard to render with interest.  You knew it wasn''t the best quality image when you entered, so what can I add that would "instruct" you?  Nothing. I like signs.  I like signs that make you do a "double take."  Hard to put them in context for sure but you did tickle a number of voters.  Isn''t it nice to know that your concept was one that touched others? Thank you for playing "closest to 5" today.', '2005-06-24 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
