(1697158, 55569, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hadn''t seen this one before, weird picture.  Actually, the picture is not weird, the line on the street is.  Actually, not weird, just unusual.  How long does it go on?  It''s a beautiful blue.  Would make driving rather difficult, I tell the kids that it''s imperative to avoid touching all white lines while driving, and I wouldn''t know what to do with a blue line.  Hmmmm.  I don''t know.</td>', 'Hadn''t seen this one before, weird picture.  Actually, the picture is not weird, the line on the street is.  Actually, not weird, just unusual.  How long does it go on?  It''s a beautiful blue.  Would make driving rather difficult, I tell the kids that it''s imperative to avoid touching all white lines while driving, and I wouldn''t know what to do with a blue line.  Hmmmm.  I don''t know.', '2005-09-12 02:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
