(3280749, 55469, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m picking this as a favourite, because it is just so distinctly South African. It''s just a typo, but it reminds me of how Afrikaans people sometimes translate English: "Hy het die pad diep gegrawe" - "He did grave the road very deep". :-)<br/> <br/>It was never going to be a prize winner, this one, but as you look back on your portfolio now, I''m sure you think fondly of how you started out.</td>', 'I''m picking this as a favourite, because it is just so distinctly South African. It''s just a typo, but it reminds me of how Afrikaans people sometimes translate English: "Hy het die pad diep gegrawe" - "He did grave the road very deep". :-) It was never going to be a prize winner, this one, but as you look back on your portfolio now, I''m sure you think fondly of how you started out.', '2007-01-25 10:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
